WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
Next, which cloud.

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:04.740
Everything here is Microsoft
Graph, version one,

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:10.063
with no Resource Manager calls at all;
Azure resource roles wait for Chapter 6.

4
00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:14.208
This estate's tenant is GCC,
so Graph is the worldwide

5
00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:17.775
host and sign-in is the
worldwide sign-in page.

6
00:00:17.775 --> 00:00:23.108
Every call's Learn page lists the global
service that G C C uses as available,

7
00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:27.150
and the governance product PIM
needs is available in G C C.

8
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.624
One small design choice matters: the
code takes an explicit cloud name

9
00:00:31.624 --> 00:00:36.240
and has no default, so nobody runs it
against the wrong cloud by accident.
